            uliftFunctor.{u+1, u} ⋙ AddCommGrpCat.free) ≫
        (wcLpscGen S V _ _ (wcLpscBetaTop S V)).hom =
        Functor.whiskerRight yβ (uliftFunctor.{u+1, u} ⋙ AddCommGrpCat.free) ≫
